		<p class="m-0">© {year} Denny Setyawan Huda · Built with Astro.</p>
		<div class="flex items-center gap-6">
			<a class="transition-colors hover:text-ink" href="/projects">Projects</a>
			<a class="transition-colors hover:text-ink" href="/contact">Contact</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
